# Varesa Furina Xilonen Xianyun. ~20s Rot. KQMS KurtC. Varesa Hypercarry with 7 plunges. Makes no attempt to obtain Electro VV. Does attempt to obtain Electro Scroll.

# Team
varesa char lvl=90/90 cons=0 talent=9,9,9;
